From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muthukumar <mk@verveflux.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Feb 2026 10:02:45 +0530
Subject: feat: add override hooks for 11 APIs (Batch 9)

WebGL: getParameter, getExtension, getShaderPrecisionFormat
WebGL2: getInternalformatParameter, getIndexedParameter, getTransformFeedbackVarying
OffscreenCanvas: transferToImageBitmap
Window: matchMedia, getComputedStyle
MediaStreamTrack: getCapabilities, getSettings

Also adds ForBinding wrappers to WebGLRenderingContextWebGPUBase.

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/local_dom_window.cc b/third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/local_dom_window.cc
